  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_spar_cb11a4298f67ade6a1c39329a2a137e2dcd6674f84ad95624168d2f2082eee0eb5">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>one of the common rafters of a roof; a pole or piece of timber of some length and moderate thickness; nautical: the general term for all masts, yards, booms, gaffs etc. (OED s.v. spar n.1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
